{"title":"2007 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 9","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_1_another_similar_way\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1 another similar way</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Real numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> satisfy the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Equation\" title=\"Equation\">equations</a> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/d/5/4d5f27672e51ebe66a48c1fc6415b7431eb92bec.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3^{a} = 81^{b + 2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"81\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/9/9095cb3077ffb9a30ad90785c4470fbf0860ced0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$125^{b} = 5^{a - 3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"90\" height=\"16\" />. What is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/8/ef870ce9fefe09b80a97b05a7b9198414c1b35f7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ab$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"19\" height=\"14\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/c/3/ac3a3ac2c5ea60d773c71b5e7728f30ac1bf5420.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ -60 \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ -17 \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ 9 \\qquad \\text{(D)}\\ 12 \\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ 60$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"413\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/2/0f2765a3b43aef194ebe11a4a63c5083344208ce.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[81^{b+2} = 3^{4(b+2)} = 3^a \\Longrightarrow a = 4b+8\\]\" width=\"277\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p>And\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/e/c/decae380961b77b05f8b9876d54f4c9777d2e402.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[125^{b} = 5^{3b} = 5^{a-3} \\Longrightarrow a - 3 = 3b\\]\" width=\"258\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p>Substitution gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/6/d76378f19645a86585270a984b337036636492f8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4b+8 - 3 = 3b \\Longrightarrow b = -5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"214\" height=\"14\" />, and solving for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> yields <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/a/dcadf6b880a738849845ef4a0bb57403e9898359.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-12$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"31\" height=\"12\" />. Thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/e/9ae4250fc6037cdf5180bfbd2f038b8cb76f87e4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ab = 60\\ \\mathrm{(E)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"90\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1_another_similar_way\">Solution 1 another similar way</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1 another similar way\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Simplify equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, which is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/9/a39024d0ecd6ac28b56ff275454b85bf70a2071c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3^a=81^{b+2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"85\" height=\"17\" />, to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/5/6/c56c25d3fba735464db559f146f747c31d423008.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3^a=3^{4b+8}$\" width=\"79\" height=\"15\" />. \n</p><p>And\n</p><p>Simplify equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, which is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/845ad1dc31db5d2a0c969c402818acfd8dcbee96.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$125^b=5^{a-3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"94\" height=\"17\" />, to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/1/9/7196dc08a396a617595bf10424caf8645951cc5d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5^{3b}=5^{a-3}$\" width=\"79\" height=\"15\" />.\n</p><p>Now, eliminate the bases from the simplified equations <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> to arrive at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/d/eedb55816971473714a069b4032b21f1901f4fc6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=4b+8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"81\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/2/8/228da89fe4ca22a6262f0d0946ee54a7ab6a5fa8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3b=a-3$\" width=\"81\" height=\"12\" />. Rewrite equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> so that it is in terms of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />. That would be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/c/f/ccf60ce78950a9b14dbb3cb52551dec7e151f445.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=3b+3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"81\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>Since both equations are equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />, and the values for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> are constant for both equations, set the equations equal to each other.\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/1/06162c381db3e01b7cfc28f35ad2d20f1f487e63.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4b+8=3b+3 \\Longrightarrow b=-5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"214\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p>Now plug <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" />, which is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/2/a526e44e36254c196af103613bc724f312b6a209.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"25\" height=\"15\" />, back into one of the two earlier equations.\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/0/ee0b5254c8391ef39ef8be0ec3d57f233ad8063c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4(-5)+8=a \\Longrightarrow -20+8=a \\Longrightarrow a=-12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"353\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/8/1/281fb71e368b30ac6d47e0c08c10214389bb92e2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(-12)(-5)=60$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"125\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>Therefore the correct answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/a/3/3a3faf1572d785ef1d5d72f120fb3a16190b4b61.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(E)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"25\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" s